---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: chbench_q9"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |  Sort: nation.n_name ASC NULLS LAST, l_year DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   Projection: nation.n_name, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"),oorder.o_entry_d) AS l_year, sum(order_line.ol_amount) AS sum_profit                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[nation.n_name, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), oorder.o_entry_d)]], aggr=[[sum(order_line.ol_amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: supplier.su_nationkey = nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |         Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND order_line.ol_d_id = oorder.o_d_id AND order_line.ol_o_id = oorder.o_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_i_id = stock.s_i_id AND order_line.ol_supply_w_id = stock.s_w_id AND order_line.ol_i_id = item.i_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: mod(stock.s_w_id * stock.s_i_id, Int64(10000)) = supplier.su_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |               Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                 TableScan: item projection=[i_id], full_filters=[item.i_data LIKE Utf8("%BB")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                 TableScan: stock projection=[s_i_id, s_w_id]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |               TableScan: supplier projection=[su_suppkey, su_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |             TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_o_id, ol_d_id, ol_w_id, ol_i_id, ol_supply_w_id, ol_amount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |           TableScan: oorder projection=[o_id, o_d_id, o_w_id, o_entry_d]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |         TableScan: nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT "nation"."n_name", date_part('YEAR', "oorder"."o_entry_d") AS "l_year", sum("order_line"."ol_amount") AS "sum_profit" FROM "item" INNER JOIN "stock" ON "item"."i_data" LIKE '%BB' INNER JOIN "supplier" ON (mod(("stock"."s_w_id" * "stock"."s_i_id"), 10000) = "supplier"."su_suppkey") INNER JOIN "order_line" ON ((("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_supply_w_id" = "stock"."s_w_id")) AND ("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "item"."i_id")) INNER JOIN "oorder" ON ((("order_line"."ol_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) AND ("order_line"."ol_o_id" = "oorder"."o_id")) INNER JOIN "nation" ON ("supplier"."su_nationkey" = "nation"."n_nationkey") GROUP BY "nation"."n_name", date_part('YEAR', "oorder"."o_entry_d") ORDER BY "nation"."n_name" ASC NULLS LAST, "l_year" DESC NULLS FIRST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
